@startuml overview
title LinguaFlow: how the six patterns work together
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class Main
class LinguaFlowFacade <<Facade>>
class ReviewManager <<Strategy context>>
interface ReviewStrategy <<Strategy>>
class EasyStrategy
class NormalStrategy
class HardStrategy
class ExerciseFactoryProvider <<Factory Method>>
interface Exercise
class ProgressTracker <<Observer subject>>
interface ProgressListener <<Observer>>
class LessonBuilder <<Builder>>
class Lesson
abstract class LessonDecorator <<Decorator>>
class SampleData

Main --> LinguaFlowFacade : uses only the facade
LinguaFlowFacade --> ReviewManager
LinguaFlowFacade --> ExerciseFactoryProvider
LinguaFlowFacade --> ProgressTracker
LinguaFlowFacade --> SampleData

ReviewManager o-- ReviewStrategy
ReviewStrategy <|.. EasyStrategy
ReviewStrategy <|.. NormalStrategy
ReviewStrategy <|.. HardStrategy

ExerciseFactoryProvider ..> Exercise : creates

ProgressTracker o-- "*" ProgressListener

SampleData ..> LessonBuilder : builds lessons
SampleData ..> LessonDecorator : extends lessons
LessonBuilder ..> Lesson : creates
LessonDecorator --|> Lesson
LessonDecorator o-- Lesson : wraps
@enduml